{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">病理基础模型：从 patch encoder 到 whole-slide 多模态推理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pathology Foundations</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_039_uni-title\">UNI</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在超过一亿病理图块上以 DINOv2 式 teacher–student 训练 ViT-L/16，向多类病理任务提供统一冻结 tile encoder。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">ViT-L/16 tile encoder pretrained via DINOv2 self-distillation and iBOT masked patch modeling on over 100 million H&amp;E histopathology patches (Mass-100K).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">全视野病理切片切出的无标签组织图块</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">256×256 H&amp;E histopathology tissue tiles extracted from whole-slide images (WSIs)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">可冻结迁移的病理图块表征及其下游切片级聚合</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Frozen transferable tile embeddings for ROI tasks or MIL whole-slide aggregation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(b) · PDF p.Official HTML Figure 1 asset</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-024-02857-3\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_039_uni')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_039_uni')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"UNI original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(b)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/37aedbbc953f7d86624b.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(b) · PDF p.Official HTML Figure 1 asset</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_039_uni\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_039_uni')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_039_uni\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">WSI 库</span><span class=\"lang-en\">WSI</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">跨器官、染色和机构的大规模全视野病理切片。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 256×256 h&amp;e histopathology tissue tiles extracted from whole-slide images (wsis) and prepares initial tensor representations (WSI).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"跨器官、染色和机构的大规模全视野病理切片。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 256×256 h&amp;e histopathology tissue tiles extracted from whole-slide images (wsis) and prepares initial tensor representations (WSI).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"WSI 库\" data-node-name-en=\"WSI\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">WSI 库</span><span class=\"lang-en\">WSI</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨器官、染色和机构的大规模全视野病理切片。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 256×256 h&amp;e histopathology tissue tiles extracted from whole-slide images (wsis) and prepares initial tensor representations (WSI).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"组织检测后从 WSI 提取高倍率图块，去除大面积背景。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Tile sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"组织 Tile 采样\" data-node-name-en=\"Tile sampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">组织 Tile 采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tile sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">组织检测后从 WSI 提取高倍率图块，去除大面积背景。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Tile sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对 tile 生成局部/全局 crops 与遮蔽 patch 视图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Multi-Crop + Mask within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Multi-Crop + Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"Multi-Crop + Mask\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Multi-Crop + Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对 tile 生成局部/全局 crops 与遮蔽 patch 视图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Multi-Crop + Mask within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"大容量视觉 Transformer 输出 tile 的 CLS 与 patch 表征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT-L/16 Student within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"ViT-L/16 Student\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT-L/16 Student\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT-L/16 Student</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">大容量视觉 Transformer 输出 tile 的 CLS 与 patch 表征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT-L/16 Student within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同构 teacher 提供平滑的全局和局部自蒸馏目标。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs EMA Teacher within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"EMA Teacher\" data-node-name-en=\"EMA Teacher\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>EMA Teacher</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同构 teacher 提供平滑的全局和局部自蒸馏目标。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs EMA Teacher within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跨增强视图对齐 tile 级 CLS 语义。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DINO objective within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"DINO 图像目标\" data-node-name-en=\"DINO objective\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">DINO 图像目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">DINO objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨增强视图对齐 tile 级 CLS 语义。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DINO objective within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在遮蔽位置预测 teacher patch 表示，保留组织局部结构。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs iBOT Patch objective within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"iBOT Patch 目标\" data-node-name-en=\"iBOT Patch objective\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">iBOT Patch 目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">iBOT Patch objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在遮蔽位置预测 teacher patch 表示，保留组织局部结构。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs iBOT Patch objective within the core pathology tile dinov2 foundation encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练后每个病理 tile 被编码为通用向量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Tile Embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"冻结 Tile Embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Tile Embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">冻结 Tile Embedding</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tile Embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练后每个病理 tile 被编码为通用向量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Tile Embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"线性探针、kNN、MIL 或其他聚合器把 tile 向量变为 ROI/WSI 预测。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces frozen transferable tile embeddings for roi tasks or mil whole-slide aggregation via Aggregator.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"任务级 Aggregator\" data-node-name-en=\"Aggregator\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_039_uni', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务级 Aggregator</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Aggregator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">线性探针、kNN、MIL 或其他聚合器把 tile 向量变为 ROI/WSI 预测。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces frozen transferable tile embeddings for roi tasks or mil whole-slide aggregation via Aggregator.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"UNI Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · UNI 联合 tile 级自蒸馏与 patch 级遮蔽蒸馏</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · UNI Joint Tile-Level DINO Self-Distillation &amp; Masked Patch iBOT Distillation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"UNI：核心公式 · UNI 联合 tile 级自蒸馏与 patch 级遮蔽蒸馏\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"39\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.655756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -68.996029 152.803914 25.655756\" width=\"152.803914pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.506851-.057964V-.420242H2.130194C1.478094-.420242 .840485-.956414 .753538-1.68097H3.383676V-2.043248H.753538C.833239-2.731576 1.405639-3.303975 2.130194-3.303975H3.506851V-3.666253H2.159177C1.152044-3.666253 .376769-2.825768 .376769-1.862109S1.152044-.057964 2.159177-.057964H3.506851Z\" id=\"m039_g7-50\"></path><path d=\"M5.376205-.485452L5.339977-.557908C5.028418-.217367 4.571948 0 4.108232 0C3.318466 0 2.557682-.239103 1.804144-.434734C2.59391-1.137553 3.043135-1.934564 3.217028-2.977925C3.303975-3.521342 3.383676-4.753087 4.14446-4.753087C4.463265-4.753087 4.738596-4.637158 4.738596-4.27488C4.738596-4.129969 4.66614-3.992303 4.564702-3.890865V-3.811164C4.738596-3.869129 5.30375-4.129969 5.30375-4.34009C5.30375-4.803806 4.702368-4.99219 4.325599-4.99219C2.347561-4.99219 2.470736-2.941697 2.086721-1.557795C2.021511-1.311446 1.68097-.543417 1.383902-.543417C1.181026-.543417 .985396-.623118 .78252-.623118C.514435-.623118 .152157-.094192 .050719 .123175L.086947 .173893C.210121 .072456 .39126-.043473 .557908-.043473C1.782408-.043473 2.905469 .623118 4.129969 .623118C4.869016 .623118 5.158838 .144911 5.376205-.485452Z\" id=\"m039_g7-76\"></path><path d=\"M7.774485-.384015C7.738258-.347787 7.687539-.32605 7.63682-.32605C7.209332-.32605 7.209332-1.507076 7.209332-1.804144C7.209332-2.753313 7.260051-4.14446 7.673047-4.999436L7.629574-5.042909C7.318015-4.970454 7.013702-4.847279 6.731125-4.695123C6.361601-3.318466 5.195066-2.391035 4.253143-1.405639C4.086496-2.050493 3.905357-2.68810